    "F6: fixed shared CSV temp file EXPORT_DIR/chamados.csv (lib.php:125-150), so concurrent exports truncate or mix content and a symlink at that path could redirect the write. Real and outside the matrix; fixed by streaming to php://output. F6 itself is credited to BUG-004 for its handle-leak sentence.",
